r confirming.If you're used to shooting with ZR, maybe A for dashing and X for jumping would work best...?We'll probably need to rethink the default button layout eventually, too.② VIRAL VANITY is now fully funct","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:15:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027810","verified_at":"2026-10-21T12:38:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4553990-1846651706693483","game_id":"steam-4553990","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest Is Here!","summary":"Steam Next Fest has begun!This is our team's first time participating, so we're both excited and a little nervous!The Fuman Ghoul demo was released about two weeks ago, and we've received lots of valuable feedback since then. Thanks to all of you, we've been able to keep improving the game!Even just yesterday and today, we've replaced some BGM and sound effects, polished the feel of various UI elements, and fine-tuned gameplay parameters.And there's more!Based on feedback from the Community Hub,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:45:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693483","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4553990-1846651706686747","game_id":"steam-4553990","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay Adjustments Based on Your Feedback","summary":"Thank you so much for playing the demo!Your feedback has been incredibly helpful in improving the game!① Button RemappingYou can now customize button and key assignments for both keyboard and gamepad controls.Along with the changes described in ②, I've also updated the default button assignments for Jump and Dash.I've also added options for PlayStation and Nintendo Switch button layouts.▲ There are still some areas that could be more user-friendly, and I'll continue improving them for the full r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T11:17:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686747","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4553990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4553990":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4553990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:44Z"},"5299510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:45Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4553990","app_id":4553990,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:40Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"89760992983a6bbf24d0505e0f86e4bedcb3ef83412a95e71fff1cc320e46bc8","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"스트레스가 괴물이 되어 나타나는 소녀의 2주간의 이야기. 장애물을 피하고 적을 물리치며 시간 내에 학교에 도착하자! 지각하면… 죽는다!? 스피디하고 귀여운 액션 어드벤처 게임입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Team Sumi"}],"developers":[{"name":"Team Sumi"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1806476400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"pv202609_kr","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792195522","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4553990/15